Negative control for filter-format-dispatch.test.ts.

Points the Bounced leaf at the OTHER tri-state format, so the column that must
draw a label-less toggle group draws the labelled button group instead. Any
assertion that reads the DRAWN control from the leaf's declared format goes red;
one that merely counts positions, or asserts "a control rendered", stays green.

